          <div class="proof-card-header">
            <span class="proof-card-tag">INTERNAL TOOLING</span>
            <h3 class="proof-card-title">SEO Automation & Internal Tooling</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-card-body">
            <div class="proof-main-metric">
              <span class="proof-metric-value">Workflow</span>
              <span class="proof-metric-desc">Tối ưu hiệu suất & Chuẩn hóa</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="proof-sub-metrics">
              <li><strong>Logfile audit</strong> · Crawl & indexing checking</li>
              <li><strong>Content audit</strong> · Intent gap & cannibalization</li>
              <li><strong>Textlink filtering</strong> · Kiểm soát chất lượng link</li>
              <li><strong>Google Sheets & Apps Script</strong> · Auto-reporting</li>
