          </p>
          <div class="audience-action-wrapper">
            <a href="/case-studies/suoi-tien-seo/" class="audience-action-link">
              Xem Case Study →
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="audience-card">
          <span class="audience-badge">Connect</span>
          <h3 class="audience-title">SEO peers / Network</h3>
          <p class="audience-desc">
            Dành cho SEO peers muốn trao đổi về Technical SEO, Content Strategy, GEO/AIO, automation hoặc workflow SEO.
          </p>
          <div class="audience-action-wrapper">
            <a href={linkedinUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="audience-action-link">
